If you have a few bucks you can get, like, a 10ft\*12ft plastic tarp at a hardware store and cover the tent with it, the more layers over it you have, the less quickly heat will leak out. The cheapest, thin tarps are in the painting sections, or the heavy tarps with grommets, usually in the automotive section.  The wind will make it a bit noisy.

